  m_text: "For generations, the rivers and forests\nof the Mekong Delta have been
    home\nto countless villages.\nEvery year, the people gather\nto celebrate the
    K\u1EF3 Y\xEAn Festival\nand perform H\xE1t B\u1ED9i for the village guardian
    spirit."
