--- !u!114 &1903367463
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1903367462}
  m_Enabled: 0
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 58edfb10b387db74ca2c71543927f33f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroManager
  pages:
  - storyText: "Southern Vietnam \r\n\r\nEarly 1900s "
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - storyText: "For generations, the rivers and forests \r\n\r\nof the Mekong Delta
      have been home \r\n\r\nto countless villages. \r\n                                                          
      Every year, the people gather \r\n\r\n                                                     
      to celebrate the K\u1EF3 Y\xEAn Festival \r\n\r\n                           
      and perform H\xE1t B\u1ED9i for the village guardian spirit. "
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - storyText: "The rivers became theirs. \r\n\r\nPeople who fight back were not
      spared \r\n\r\n                                                               
      Villages were abandoned.  \r\n\r\n                                   Families
      fled deep into the mangrove forests, \r\n\r\n                             
      leaving behind the places they once called home. "
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - storyText: "In the chaos, \r\nthe sacred H\xE1t B\u1ED9i costume \r\nused during
      the K\u1EF3 Y\xEAn Festival \r\nwas lost. \r\n                                                                                       
      Without it\r\n                                                             
      the festival cannot be held. \r\n                                                                        
      \nWithout the festival, \r\nthe blessing of the guardian spirit \r\ncannot
      reach the village. "
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - storyText: "Most have given up hope. \r\n\r\nBut one performer refuses. \r\n\r\nHis
      name is T\xED. "
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - storyText: "The shore is safe. \r\n\r\nThe water belongs to the crocodiles. \r\n\r\nAnd
      every step beyond the riverbank \r\n\r\nmay be his last."
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - storyText: "Recover the three costume pieces. \r\n\r\nRestore the K\u1EF3 Y\xEAn
      Festival. \r\n\r\nReceive the blessing of the guardian spirit. \r\n\r\nAnd
      face the crocodiles one final time. "
    image: {fileID: 10907, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
  - storyText: "\nThen they arrived. \r\n\r\nStrange beings in the shape of crocodiles
      \r\n\r\nfell from beyond the stars. \r                                                                  
      Claiming to be superior, \r\n\r\n                                                     
      they declared humanity unworthy \n\n                                                          
      of the land and its resources. "
    image: {fileID: 10907, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
  - storyText: "\nThen they arrived. \r\n\r\nStrange beings in the shape of crocodiles
      \r\n\r\nfell from beyond the stars. \r                                                                  
      Claiming to be superior, \r\n\r\n                                                     
      they declared humanity unworthy \n\n                                                          
      of the land and its resources. "
    image: {fileID: 10907, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
  currentImage: {fileID: 1256846904}
  currentText: {fileID: 1743341040}
  nextPage: {fileID: 2096188464}
  nextImage: {fileID: 697377297}
  nextText: {fileID: 1392921126}
  currentPage: {fileID: 508631569}
